#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:10 a49c3deb64904e0294a13e0452f9334a
msgid ""
"A \"Relay\" is a digital output pin on the autopilot that can be switched "
"between 0 volts and either 3.3V or 5V, depending on the autopilot.  Similar "
"to a servo it allows the autopilot to invoke some action from another device"
" on the vehicle.  Up to 6 relays can be implemented."
msgstr ""
"「继电器」是飞控上的一个数字输出引脚，可在0V与3.3V或5V（取决于飞控）之间切换。与舵机类似，它允许飞控从飞行器上的其他设备触发某些动作。最多可实现6路继电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:12 e82cd1c505a548eaac6cd48e867ba912
msgid ""
"The digital outputs that can be used as a relay are GPIOs. Normal "
"servo/motor outputs can be configured for GPIO use. Occasionally, an "
"autopilot will dedicate some pins for purely GPIO use as internal power "
"controls, general purpose use,.etc. Consult the autopilot's documentation "
"for pin number and information. In addition, it is possible to create a "
"DroneCAN peripheral that has dedicated pins for relay use and these can be "
"controlled as remote relays."
msgstr ""
"可用作继电器的数字输出为 GPIO。普通舵机/电机输出可配置为 GPIO 使用。有些飞控还会专门为内部电源控制、通用用途等留有专用 GPIO "
"引脚。请查阅飞控文档了解引脚编号及详细信息。此外，还可以创建具有专用继电器引脚的 DroneCAN 外设，这些引脚可作为远程继电器进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:15 8d6e72da65644c56945d85a07646379a
msgid "Relay Parameter Setup"
msgstr "继电器参数设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:17 cc23663bd2614d9d96982dc9582b4616
msgid ""
"Setup of a relay requires that which pin it controls be set, and its default"
" state. In addition, some autopilot functions can be assigned to the relay."
msgstr "继电器设置需要指定其控制的引脚及默认状态。此外，某些飞控功能也可分配给继电器。"

