#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:60 75e1ed65f50c44619925ce3d9403d48b
msgid ""
"This screen allows setting RC5 thru RC14, but any RC channel (1-16) can have"
" its ``RCx_OPTION`` (See :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`) set as a RELAY, "
