msgstr "任务控制继电器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:65 36dab1787823453ab82da9cf78f7d3c2
msgid ""
"Similar to a servo, the Relays can be activated during a mission using the "
"Do-Set-Relay mission command.  This is described on the :ref:`Copter Mission"
" Command List wiki page <copter:mission-command-list_do-set-relay>`."
msgstr ""
"与舵机类似，继电器可在任务执行期间通过 Do-Set-Relay 任务命令激活。详情请参阅 :ref:`Copter 任务命令列表 wiki 页面 "
"<copter:mission-command-list_do-set-relay>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:68 17ca06ffb64f49f68d3e4657dcba830c
msgid ""
